pocing
================

This is a cleaned, hardened fork of taker (https://github.com/tachote/taker),
copyright (c) the taker authors, distributed under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

Forked from upstream commit bf29019. Changes in this fork:
  - Burp Suite light theme (default for `pocing http`), fitted against a real
    Burp capture: message-editor header and controls, Pretty-printed HTML,
    current-line band, bottom search toolbar and scrollbar with a
    `--max-lines` viewport. `--theme dark` is Burp's macOS dark theme with
    the same layout and chrome, every colour measured from a real capture.
  - Message text drawn like Burp on macOS: unhinted, on Burp's 8px cells, with
    the glyphs' alignment zones snapped to whole pixels (font/zone.go). Menlo
    is not included; DejaVu Sans Mono stands in for it.
  - Vietnamese and other accented text: the 46 precomposed letters DejaVu Sans
    Mono does not carry are assembled at render time from a base glyph and a
    combining mark of that same font (font/compose.go), and input is
    NFC-normalised, rather than falling back to a second typeface.
  - Embedded DejaVu Sans Mono 2.37 regular and bold (Bitstream Vera / DejaVu
    licence, font/LICENSE-DejaVu.txt) for HTTP message text, and Inter 4.1
    regular and bold (SIL Open Font License 1.1, font/LICENSE-Inter.txt) for
    the HTTP chrome and titles.
  - Hardening: removed the README reference to an external third-party
    integration, pinned GitHub Actions to commit SHAs, release config no longer
    publishes to the upstream repository.

No network, process-execution, telemetry or credential-handling code exists in
this fork.
